      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Auto Transport Lead Scraper (US)\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs each morning to scrape U.S. auto transport leads from Google Maps via SerpAPI. It reads active states from Google Sheets, expands each state into keyword queries, loops through the searches, extracts and validates business lead data, enriches leads with contact emails where possible, generates an AI-written outreach email, and saves the final records back to Google Sheets. It also logs SerpAPI-specific failures and workflow-level errors to separate sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the schedule trigger for the desired run time and timezone.\n- Fill the Set Config node with the SerpAPI API key and the input, output, and error Google Sheet IDs.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials with read access to the states sheet and write access to the leads and error log sheets.\n- Connect OpenAI credentials for the AI Email node.\n- Verify the input sheet contains active state rows and any expected keyword/state fields used by the query-building nodes.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the state filter, keyword expansion code, search query template, delays, validation rules, email extraction logic, and AI outreach prompt to match different lead criteria or outreach styles."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
